{"2022380": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Secret of Rooms", "steam_appid": 2022380, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>About our team</h1><p>Hi. We’re 3 people who are really really into murder mysteries. So much so that despite being scrubs, we made an escape room game in our spare time. We had so much fun that we thought, what the heck… let's throw it out on the internet for a roasting. Thus, NoFace Studio was born. We call ourselves NoFace cause where we’re from, face = respectability, and as wannabe developers, we’re pretty low on the industry totem pole. Maybe in a few years we’ll put out a lootbox-ridden grindfest and change our name to thick face studio /s. Until then we are NoFace Studio and you can follow our story by searching for The Secret of Room on WeChat, Weibo, Bilibili and Facebook, or commiserate with other The Secret of Room players in our QQ group: 609847577</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>&quot;the Secret of  Rooms&quot; is a drama-oriented puzzle-solving game in a modern setting.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Gameplay] </h2>You wake up at the door of a strange room and get a phone call from your boss, urging you to investigate the disappearance of a female reporter that has caused a sensation in the city.<br>During the investigation, you are in a bizarre room cycle. In a room with distinctive human characteristics, look for clues, crack the secret room, restore the story that happened to them.Eventually, the world thread reveals the creepy secrets. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2022380/extras/2909830ccb4a04572870560964443997.avif?t=1695809290\" width=600 height=300 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2022380/extras/119e05ea8e864f55628f596997fdf3e0.avif?t=1695809290\" width=600 height=224 /></span><br><br>Ju